not endorse Vesper.

The Flatpak manifest and launcher adapt packaging from the Flathub
org.signal.Signal repository:
https://github.com/flathub/org.signal.Signal

The reference revision is
4b01aa79a739df6ff109d133865a967995bb73a4. Relevant source files are
org.signal.Signal.yaml and signal-desktop.sh. Bernhard Bermeitinger and other
Flathub contributors authored that packaging under CC0-1.0. Vesper keeps the
runtime and zypak mechanics but uses its own application identity, locally
built payload, launcher text and update configuration. The Vesper AppStream
metadata is also CC0-1.0.

